# Everything SRW writes in its working directory beside <module>.asm, one
# name per line: the segments of this EXE, each with its data and, where the
# segment holds code, its code. Stage 2 (recomp) produces these, stage 3 (gen)
# copies them to build/gen/; they are game data, so they are listed here and
# not guessed at. The PE's .idata/.rsrc/.reloc (seg04/08/09) are not game data
# and are resolved by the loader instead.
seg01_code.llinc
seg01_data.llinc
seg02_data.llinc
seg03_data.llinc
